{"speciesId":283,"names":{"fr":"Arakdo","es":"Surskit","en":"Surskit","ja":"アメタマ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"From the tips of its feet, SURSKIT secretes an oil that enables it to walk on water as if it were skating. This POKéMON feeds on microscopic organisms in ponds and lakes."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"If SURSKIT senses danger, it secretes a thick, sugary syrup from the tip of its head. There are some POKéMON that love eating this syrup."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"They gather on puddles after evening downpours, gliding across the surface of water as if sliding. It secretes honey with a sweet aroma from its head."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"They usually live on ponds, but after an evening shower, they may appear on puddles in towns."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"They usually live on ponds, but after an evening shower, they may appear on puddles in towns."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It secretes a thick, sweet-scented syrup from the tip of its head. It lives on weed-choked ponds."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It secretes a thick, sweet-scented syrup from the tip of its head. It lives on weed-choked ponds."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il semble patiner sur l’eau. Le parfum diffusé par le sommet de sa tête sert à attirer ses proies."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il semble patiner sur l’eau. Le parfum diffusé par le sommet de sa tête sert à attirer ses proies."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ils vivent généralement dans les étangs mais, après des averses passagères, on peut en trouver dans des flaques au milieu des villes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en estanques, pero cuando se desata una tormenta puede aparecer en los charcos que se forman en las ciudades."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They usually live on ponds, but after an evening shower, they may appear on puddles in towns."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"普段は 池に 住んでいるが 夕立の 後には 街中の 水たまりに 姿を 現す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il semble patiner sur l’eau. Le parfum diffusé par le sommet de sa tête sert à attirer ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Parece que patina sobre el agua. Atrae a las presas con el suave aroma de su cabeza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"水面を 滑るように 歩く。 頭の 先から 甘い においを 出して 獲物を 誘う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Du bout de ses pattes, Arakdo sécrète une huile lui permettant de marcher sur l’eau, comme s’il glissait. Ce Pokémon se nourrit des organismes microscopiques présents dans les lacs et les étangs."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Surskit segrega un aceite por la punta de las patas que le permite caminar sobre el agua como si fuera patinando. Este Pokémon se alimenta de microorganismos en charcas y lagos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"From the tips of its feet, Surskit secretes an oil that enables it to walk on water as if it were skating. This Pokémon feeds on microscopic organisms in ponds and lakes."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"つま先から 油が にじみ出て いるので 水の 上を 滑る ように 歩けるのだ。 池や 湖の 微生物を 食べている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsque Arakdo se sent en danger, le haut de sa tête sécrète un sirop épais et sucré. Certains Pokémon adorent boire de ce sirop."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando Surskit siente que hay peligro, segrega un néctar espeso y dulce por la cabeza. Hay Pokémon a los que les encanta bebérselo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"If Surskit senses danger, it secretes a thick, sugary syrup from the tip of its head. There are some Pokémon that love eating this syrup."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"危険を 感じると 頭の 先っぽから 水あめのような 甘い 液体を 出す。 これが 好物の ポケモンも いるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Ce Pokémon se déplace en glissant à la surface de l’eau. Les Arakdo se chamaillent souvent avec les Araqua pour de la nourriture."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se mueve como si patinara sobre el agua. Suele pelearse con Dewpider por la comida."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It moves as if skating on the surface of the water. It often fights with Dewpider over food."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"水面を 滑るように 移動。 餌を 求めて シズクモと ケンカすることも しばしば。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Dès qu’il se sent en danger, le sommet de sa tête sécrète un liquide sucré, qui a le don de provoquer le dégoût chez les Pokémon oiseaux."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Si se encuentra en peligro, segrega un líquido dulce que los Pokémon pájaro encuentran desagradable."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"When this Pokémon senses danger, a sweet fluid oozes from the tip of its head. The taste of it disgusts bird Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"危険が 及ぶと 頭の 先から 甘い味の 液体が にじみだす。 とりポケモンが 嫌いな味だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"En cas de danger, il sécrète un liquide sucré du sommet de sa tête. Le sirop fabriqué à partir de ce liquide est délicieux étalé sur du pain !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Si se siente amenazado, segrega un líquido dulce por la cabeza. El sirope elaborado con ese líquido resulta delicioso untado en pan."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"If it’s in a pinch, it will secrete a sweet liquid from the tip of its head. Syrup made from gathering that liquid is tasty on bread."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ピンチに なると 突起から 甘い 汁を 出す。 これを 集めた シロップは パンにつけると 美味い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il vit dans les lacs ou les marais où prospèrent les plantes hydrophiles. Il se dispute souvent proies et territoire avec son voisin, Araqua."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Vive en estanques y pantanales donde abunde la flora acuática y compite fieramente con los Dewpider por el territorio y el sustento."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It lives in ponds and marshes that feature lots of plant life. It often fights with Dewpider, whose habitat and diet are similar."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"水草の 多い 池や 沼に 棲む。 棲息地も 食う エサも 近い シズクモと よく 争う。"}],"varieties":[{"id":283,"moves":[{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"mist","learns":[[5,"level-up",37],[6,"level-up",37],[7,"level-up",37],[8,"level-up",37],[9,"level-up",37],[10,"level-up",37],[11,"level-up",37],[12,"level-up",37],[13,"level-up",37],[14,"level-up",37],[15,"level-up",37],[16,"level-up",25],[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[23,"level-up",25],[25,"level-up",25]]},{"name":"